  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business opportunties report Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this market study in Libya is to gain better insight into the economic focus sectors of the Netherlands embassy in Tripoli, Libya, and increase bilateral cooperation by bringing together needs and opportunities in Libya and Dutch solutions and technologies.These economic focus sectors are the&#x2022;	Maritime, including port development,&#x2022;	Healthcare, and&#x2022;	Food and agricultural sector, including climate-smart agriculture.Here are some other relevant sectors that could be approached:&#x2022;	Construction and engineering&#x2022;	Water Management&#x2022;	Renewable Energy&#x2022;	Environmental sector.The study will lead to at least three concrete business leads and one lead for Government-to-Government (G2G) cooperation. Furthermore, the intervention will gain better insight into the concrete needs of the public sector for capacity building on themes such as local governance, women and youth empowerment, diplomacy skills, reconciliation, etc. Also, the intervention will assess the security risks of doing business in Libya and how to mitigate them.</narrative>
  </description>
